					<Table CellPadding="0" CellSpacing="0" width="100%">
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsDate" id="NewsDate">Wednesday, April 30, 2003</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsTitle" id="NewsTitle">Patch day</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsAuthor" id="NewsAuthor">By
									Reny
								</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td colspan="2" height="10"></td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="center"><p align=left>Well we got a bit of a late start.  We started with an Avatar of War.  We lost Aeryl mid-way because of a bit of lag by the goldenboy.  We recovered nicely and set him on his face.  Congrats to Fenaru on her on her new Flayed Barbarian Skin Mask.  Well see her in barb form quite a bit I am sure.  Aeryl(und) snagged a Blade of Carnage. Xiaotan(und) found himself a War Bow of Rallos Zek.  I am sure the Avatar of War wont miss it.
<p align=left>
Headed off to seru yet again for another Lord Inquister Seru kill.  Same old, same old.  He wont be inquisting no more.  Congrats go to Yaden on his head. Canilya picked up a spiffy pair of Yitrium Vambraces.  Kirden(und) is looking very snazy in his new Heavy Yitrium Chestplate. Whats thats in the sunset?  Its Falshir(und) riding off on his Black Ornate Chain Bridle.
<p align=left>
Was getting late but there was work still to be done so we entered ST to off the warders and Final Arbitor.  Congrats to those who won trinkets and new toys.
<p>
<a href="/screenshots/AoW-4-30.jpg"><img src="/screenshots/AoW-4-30.jpg" border=0 width=800></a> </td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td colspan="2" height="20" align="center" valign="middle"><IMG SRC="/images/alayrule.gif"></td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
					</Table>
				
					<Table CellPadding="0" CellSpacing="0" width="100%">
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsDate" id="NewsDate">Thursday, April 24, 2003</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsTitle" id="NewsTitle">Goodnight. Sleep Tight</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="left"><span class="NewsAuthor" id="NewsAuthor">By
									Reny
								</span>
							</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td colspan="2" height="10"></td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="center"><p align=left>
We started off the evening with a trip to see the crystaline dragon of valor.  Must say it was a walk in the park.  Aerin'dar didnt stand a chance nor did the golems waiting patiently to be slaughted like lambs after the fight.  Congrats to those now flagged for Halls of Honor and congrats to Marq on his new Double-edged Greatsword of Visions otherwise known as the #3 with fried rice.  Ousal of DI walked away with a nice offhander the Honorable Longsword.
<p align=left>
Next it was time to take out the that nag Terris Thule.  After a false start and a 10 min time time out in the penality box we killed her with /gasp an SK tanking most the fight.  She was sent back to her lalala dreamland.  Falamil got a deal on his new Indigo Snake Bracelet and Bodand(DI) slid a Carved Bone Ring onto his finger.
<p>
<a href="/screenshots/Terris-Thule-4-24.jpg"><img src="/screenshots/Terris-Thule-4-24.jpg" border=0 width=800>
</td>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
						</tr>
