						<tr>
							<td Width="10" bgcolor="black"></td>
							<td Width="10"></td>
							<td align="center">Was a slow evening so we hit up our old friend Lord Y.  He was nice enough to donate a few trinkets to our cause.
<li>Osler - Yelinak's Head</li>
<li>Santsai(und) - Celestial Essence Robe</li>
<li>Vexil(und) - Yelinak's Talisman</li>
<li>Clerik - Ayill's Aged Stone Shield</li>
<li>Marq - Dragons Blood Earring</li>
<li>Undaunted - Dragons Blood Earring</li>
<br>
<br>
